  "name": "Guge and feige (Qiandongnan Miao ancient songs and flying songs)",
  "family": "global",
  "lineage": "Vocal traditions of the Hmub (Miao) of Qiandongnan in south-east Guizhou. The ancient songs are long epic cycles on the creation of heaven and earth, the origins of humankind and the migrations of the Miao, sung in question and answer between paired singers at festivals, weddings and sacrifices; the flying songs (feige) are loud, high outdoor songs called across the hills. Miao ancient songs are listed on China's national intangible-heritage register.",
